# Runtime MCP data must never land in the seed tree: normally it lives under
# ~/myagent/config/mcp/, but a dev pointing MYAGENT_CONFIG at server/config
# would write server tokens (cleartext) straight into the repo. The rest of
# server/config/ is the shipped seed template and stays tracked.
server/config/mcp/

